  "_doc": [
    "Word lists for hmlib.english_problems(): text meant for the plugin's GitHub repository (skill issues, pull",
    "requests, code) must be English. 'english' holds common English function words: English prose always has",
    "many. 'foreign' holds common function words of other languages, written without diacritics, that are not",
    "also English words or common technical terms (so no 'die', 'der', 'des', 'per', 'van', 'mit', 'pro', 'su', 'len', 'ci',",
    "'pod', 'take'), and no one-letter words, which are common variable names.",
    "Letters outside ASCII are caught separately."
  ],
